s=ba75aaf32fc55f4bc2559390060dd84f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/29ad8703/uploads/origins/d5bcf3cd-1c26-4ce9-bf63-7d2ccf287a3e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=aab3346c9fd49aab598a4dee20ac0bb2 3x"}, "body": "Hello\n I recently saw your yugioh artwork and I really love it! I would like to inquire about a commission.\n\nDetails:\nwallpaper/playmat personal use commission\n\nCharacters:\nTakanashi Kiara from Hololive EN\nDiabellstar the black witch (alternative art)\nDiabellze the original sinkeeper\nJimmy the chicken,  the Kiara Mascot\n\nConcept: I'm a big fan of the White Forest deck and Takanashi Kiara from Hololive. So for this concept I would like to have artwork in which Kiara is a duelist and has a duel disk on her arm.\nKiara is striking an action pose with a card and the duel disk and she has Diabellstar and Diabellze at her side with Jimmy the mascot near her feet. I will attach reference materials.\n\nBackground could be very minimal but an interesting concept could be with a crowd on a stage. Like an idol performance, or a duel in front of her fans.\n\nReference material\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1dP0rNiA6K4Q3Lzwlg1-cQM1iewd6b8N9?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1dP0rNiA6K4Q3Lzwlg1-cQM1iewd6b8N9?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@puka_bgart/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3480191, "client_id": 3418897, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/325331d2/uploads/origins/8dcd99e8-4e14-4424-b5c8-22d78d6d3d50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0338aac66c9ee6848181e96fb6abe938", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/325331d2/uploads/origins/8dcd99e8-4e14-4424-b5c8-22d78d6d3d50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0338aac66c9ee6848181e96fb6abe938, https://si.imgix.net/325331d2/uploads/origins/8dcd99e8-4e14-4424-b5c8-22d78d6d3d50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=11508905c9da9decd072bf411aa6d156 2x, https://si.imgix.net/325331d2/uploads/origins/8dcd99e8-4e14-4424-b5c8-22d78d6d3d50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=449dfc0e962a4ea2454c39fc3bc969e6 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/325331d2/uploads/origins/8dcd99e8-4e14-4424-b5c8-22d78d6d3d50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f137444462c8f82d82581339101e5278", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/325331d2/uploads/origins/8dcd99e8-4e14-4424-b5c8-22d78d6d3d50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f137444462c8f82d82581339101e5278, https://si.imgix.net/325331d2/uploads/origins/8dcd99e8-4e14-4424-b5c8-22d78d6d3d50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9b392fbffb3f665c2bc964c59313a27c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/325331d2/uploads/origins/8dcd99e8-4e14-4424-b5c8-22d78d6d3d50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=52cdf3a48f69d32e043fdec192cdae32 3x"}, "body": "初めまして😊個人Vtuberとして活動している七愛ななです。\n納品されたイラストを見ていたら先生の背景に目を奪われたので依頼させていただきました\n\n◎特徴▶猫耳、前髪インテーク、目の中の花びらハイライト(花びら4つ)\n◎キャラクター▶見た目はお姉さんですが、ナマケモノ、元気いっぱいのキャラクターになります\n◎希望▶配信画面に使いたいので横画面用のサイズでお願いいたします。（１６：９）\nその他、衣装・表情はお任せします\n描いていただきたい構図など思いつかなくて申し訳ないです。\nできればヨーロッパの街並みのような背景を見てみたいです\nキャラクターは後ろを向いていたり、目立たなくても大丈夫です。\nとにかく背景がとても素敵ですのでお任せします\n\nキャラクターはURLをご覧下さい\n\n◎使用用途▶配信の待機画面(準備中など文字を入れる予定です)\n\n以上大丈夫なようでしたら承認をお願いします。\n\n要望が多くて申し訳ないです\n\nhttps://x.com/nathika_nana/status/1849587422146986371?t=sZFLcNMII_UIFdEXrh61qQ&s=19", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@puka_bgart/works/6", "privat